          "goal": "规划库存报表与机器导出边界",
          "prompt": "Plan the supplied inventory report: explicit field order, literal identifiers, prices, None versus empty strings, immutable source records and a separate machine-readable export. Use existing APIs and state format limits. Do not implement changes.",
          "requires": [],
          "materials": [
